---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import ArticleCard from '../../components/ArticleCard.astro';import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';import {href} from '../../lib/paths';
const entries=(await getCollection('experiments')).sort((a,b)=>a.data.order-b.data.order);
---
<Base title="Five transmission-line experiments" description="Learn wave propagation, reflection, standing waves, lossy lines and the Heaviside distortionless condition through five substantial WaveLab experiment guides." path="experiments/"><div class="container"><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Theory meets observation</span><h1>Five experiments.<br/>A connected understanding.</h1><p class="lede">Build intuition from a matched traveling wave to reflections, attenuation and distortionless propagation. Read the assumptions as carefully as the equations.</p></header><div class="grid grid-2 section">{entries.map((e,i)=><ArticleCard title={e.data.title} description={e.data.description} path={`experiments/${e.id}/`} label="Guided experiment" number={String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}/>)}</div><div class="callout"><p>These pages explain an implemented workflow for an authorized WaveLab build. The application is not publicly downloadable yet. <a href={href('download/')}>Check release status</a>.</p></div></div></Base>
